////////////////////////////////////////// TEXT //////////////////////////////////////////

text StartMessage{
    "Welcome to the Escape Room!\p"
    "Solve puzzles, navigate tough battles,\n"
    "and find creative solutions in order to\l"
    "progress through the map.\p"

    "WHAT YOU NEED TO KNOW:\p"

    "1) The game's battle mechanics are\n"
    "based on GEN 9.\l"
    "However, match tiebreakers will mirror\l"
    "competitive battling rules.\p"
    
    "2) Battle RNG is disabled.\n"
    "Catch rates, accuracy, damage, and move\l"
    "effects are now deterministic.\l"
    "Generally, the most intuitive outcome\l"
    "is set to happen.\p"

    "3) There is no need for grinding of any\n"
    "kind.\p"

    "4) Every item found directly on the map\n"
    "will be inside an item ball.\p"

    "5) Trainer battles have a forfeit option\n"
    "(Run), which counts as a regular loss.\p"

    "6) It is possible to softlock yourself\n"
    "during play, so using save states is\l"
    "highly recommended.\p"

    "Good luck!"
}

